WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.534 --> 00:00:13.522
Past the bright light, Ivy saw a dark silhouette.

2
00:00:13.542 --> 00:00:15.303
"Oh, no!

3
00:00:15.784 --> 00:00:16.625
It's Private!"

4
00:00:17.065 --> 00:00:17.705
she whispered.

5
00:00:18.806 --> 00:00:20.628
She and Glen climbed back through the hole.

6
00:00:24.731 --> 00:00:26.052
Private loomed over them.

7
00:00:29.255 --> 00:00:30.296
Ezra raised his hand.

8
00:00:31.252 --> 00:00:32.933
"H-how did you find us?"

9
00:00:32.953 --> 00:00:35.534
"Security cameras."

10
00:00:36.775 --> 00:00:38.295
Private pointed up to the trees.

11
00:00:38.315 --> 00:00:42.937
"I'm on constant lookout for deserters."

12
00:00:44.018 --> 00:00:46.339
Private ordered them to go straight to their cabins.

13
00:00:47.599 --> 00:00:48.260
Ivy gulped.

14
00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:51.241
They were in big, big trouble.

15
00:00:53.202 --> 00:00:57.103
The next morning they stood in Private's office, waiting to be punished.

16
00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.562
Private blew her whistle, making everyone jump.

17
00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:04.744
Then she glared at them.

18
00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:08.887
“I know why your contest idea was top secret.

19
00:01:09.527 --> 00:01:11.128
You planned to escape!

20
00:01:12.509 --> 00:01:16.792
So now you need to do something positive for Camp Evergreen."

21
00:01:16.812 --> 00:01:21.295
“Sending us home might be positive," Ivy thought.

22
00:01:21.315 --> 00:01:25.558
"You'll paint the showers," Private said.

23
00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:27.540
Ivy groaned.

24
00:01:28.268 --> 00:01:30.770
"The showers are disgusting!"

25
00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:35.935
"Yep." Private led them to a supply closet.

26
00:01:37.476 --> 00:01:40.779
Inside were a dozen old, dented cans of paint.

27
00:01:40.799 --> 00:01:45.923
"I'll inspect the job before dinner," she said.

28
00:01:47.144 --> 00:01:48.846
Then she left the kids to their work.

29
00:01:50.948 --> 00:01:51.708
Ezra sighed.

30
00:01:51.728 --> 00:01:55.472
"Private should have stayed in the army."

31
00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:59.281
"She left because it wasn't tough enough for her!"

32
00:02:00.442 --> 00:02:01.443
Glen reminded him.

33
00:02:02.763 --> 00:02:04.905
The kids grabbed some paint cans and brushes.

34
00:02:06.325 --> 00:02:08.106
They headed first to the boys' showers.

35
00:02:11.268 --> 00:02:12.349
Glen opened a can.

36
00:02:12.369 --> 00:02:16.051
"These showers are the creepiest place in camp.

37
00:02:17.432 --> 00:02:19.633
I've heard that bats live in one of the stalls!"

38
00:02:19.653 --> 00:02:25.076
"I stay away from the showers," Ezra said.

39
00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:27.781
"The bacteria levels are deadly."

40
00:02:27.801 --> 00:02:31.364
"Wait—it's your third summer.

41
00:02:32.144 --> 00:02:34.046
You've never taken a shower?"

42
00:02:34.606 --> 00:02:35.967
Ivy asked in disbelief.

43
00:02:37.328 --> 00:02:38.008
Ezra shrugged.

44
00:02:38.028 --> 00:02:40.950
"I swim in the lake once a week."

45
00:02:44.873 --> 00:02:47.275
Glen gazed into the half-empty paint cans.

46
00:02:47.295 --> 00:02:50.437
"We can't paint the showers.

47
00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:52.918
There's not enough of one color."

48
00:02:54.259 --> 00:02:55.120
Ezra bit his lip.

49
00:02:56.112 --> 00:02:58.394
"We'll never get this job done!"

50
00:03:00.475 --> 00:03:02.497
Ivy looked at all the different paint colors.

51
00:03:04.038 --> 00:03:05.719
Then she looked up at her friends again.

52
00:03:05.739 --> 00:03:11.844
"Actually," she said slowly, "this is perfect!"

53
00:03:16.127 --> 00:03:17.628
The kids got busy painting.

54
00:03:20.991 --> 00:03:21.912
It was a hot day.

55
00:03:23.176 --> 00:03:26.138
They were sweaty and tired when they finished the boys' showers.

56
00:03:27.959 --> 00:03:29.801
Then they moved on to the girls' showers.

57
00:03:32.422 --> 00:03:35.124
Ezra sat on Glen's shoulders to reach the high spots.

58
00:03:36.385 --> 00:03:40.248
Ivy got green paint in her hair, and Glen's hands were pink and purple.

59
00:03:42.309 --> 00:03:46.472
Right before the dinner bugle blew, Private arrived with Larry and Penelope.

60
00:03:51.795 --> 00:03:53.908
beautiful!" Penelope cried.

61
00:03:53.928 --> 00:04:00.030
"That's, like, so colorful, like the way my dreams look," Larry said.

62
00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:02.971
Private gave them a quick nod.

63
00:04:04.111 --> 00:04:06.332
The three painters exchanged high-fives.

64
00:04:07.692 --> 00:04:10.273
The dark, dirty showers had been transformed.

65
00:04:11.413 --> 00:04:15.094
Now there were colorful murals of Camp Evergreen's woods and blue lake.

66
00:04:16.054 --> 00:04:23.264
Ivy had also hidden some fun details—like poison ivy and a creepy daddy longlegs.

67
00:04:23.284 --> 00:04:27.827
That evening during assembly, the campers performed their acts for the spirit contest.

68
00:04:29.229 --> 00:04:32.131
Wes tooted his new song and his friends sang along.

69
00:04:33.452 --> 00:04:35.073
The Ucks arm-wrestled each other.

70
00:04:40.697 --> 00:04:43.779
At last Private blew her whistle to announce the winners.

71
00:04:43.799 --> 00:04:47.362
"Who has the best Evergreen spirit?

72
00:04:48.363 --> 00:04:49.964
I think we can all agree.

73
00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:56.802
This year's award goes to Everyone held their breath as Private paused.

74
00:04:58.182 --> 00:05:02.883
"Three talented painters—Ivy, Glen, and Ezra!"

75
00:05:02.903 --> 00:05:06.144
"Huh?" Ivy blinked.

76
00:05:07.785 --> 00:05:09.525
The crowd burst into applause.

77
00:05:10.685 --> 00:05:13.006
The three campers accepted their blue ribbons.

78
00:05:13.026 --> 00:05:15.947
"I knew I'd be a legend!"

79
00:05:16.327 --> 00:05:16.927
Glen said.

80
00:05:16.947 --> 00:05:19.908
"My parents will be so proud!"

81
00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:21.101
Ezra cried.

82
00:05:21.121 --> 00:05:22.964
"No way."

83
00:05:23.785 --> 00:05:24.987
Ivy stared at her ribbon.

84
00:05:25.007 --> 00:05:28.552
"I can't have the best Evergreen spirit.

85
00:05:29.333 --> 00:05:30.756
I hate this place!"

86
00:05:32.077 --> 00:05:36.123
But that thought didn't stop a huge smile from spreading across her face.
